                </div>

                <div class="nt-interactive-card">
                    <div style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">🚌</div>
                    <h3 style="color: #fff; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;">Autobuses Intermunicipales</h3>
