            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;">
                <div class="nt-interactive-card">
                    <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--nt-blue); font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase;">Nivel 1</span>
                    <h4 style="color: #fff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 0.3rem 0 0.5rem 0;">Repartidor Urbano</h4>
                    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; margin: 0;">Entregas de paqueteria pequeña usando furgonetas. Ideal para acumular capital inicial.</p>
                </div>
